es</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic 2D side scrolling action adventure.<br></li><li>Tightly refined controls for challenging combat and platforming action. <br></li><li>Explore mossy bathhouses, cabaret theatre or a moldy greenhouse within a vast interconnected world. <br></li><li>Rediscover and utilize your carnivore abilities assisting you in both combat and exploration.  <br></li><li>Devour your adversaries, whether they're men or beasts. Utilize their abilities in combat. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/df26a1268f07de907f65e4dd43df9259.poster.avif?t=1758281238\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/df26a1268f07de907f65e4dd43df9259.webm?t=1758281238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/df26a1268f07de907f65e4dd43df9259.mp4?t=1758281238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Chart the layout of the kingdom using your acute sense of smell and urination of claimed territories. <br></li><li>Equip various trinkets and talismans for a further customization of your playstyle. <br></li><li>Hand drawn 2D traditional animation style.<br></li><li>Original and evocative soundtrack, composed by Sky To Speak. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/d23b8ca6abe2a1c1008596a97fc82cf1.poster.avif?t=1758281238\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826400/extras/d23b8ca6abe2a1c1008596a97fc82cf1.webm?t=1758281238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">